    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d875">

                <pb facs="1011" n="917" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg917"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received Aug. 28.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 945.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a copy of a
                    telegram from Consular Agent Poche of August 10, informing me that naturalized
                    American prisoners at Aleppo clamor for more food. I inclose also a copy of my
                    telegram to Consul Madden at Smyrna, forwarded for the information of the
                    captain of the <hi rendition="#italic">San Francisco.</hi></p>
                <p>The prisoners are reported as revolutionists by a former telegram from Poche.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d875-a1.xml" xpointer="d875-a1"/>
